/* The repo this deploys from is public, and the standing rule is that keys
# The repo this deploys from is public and keys live in .env.local, a name this
# file did not cover, so the first one created would have been committed.
#   anyone created one it would have been committed to a public repository. */
.env.local
.env*.local

